{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S02—S04等段的感受词有些堆叠，水波、漂浮、摇荡等意象反复出现，容易让注意力从叙事转向修辞；X的因果句更连贯，表达也更克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮短句把每段的情绪转折直接标出来，边听边扫更容易抓住主线；按音乐小节出现的感受词，以及反复回来的水与船的意象，也让音乐细节和整段心境联系得更紧。X在解释人物动机时，完整句子的因果关系更顺畅，所以「为什么这样」略胜，但整体上Y更容易让观众同时抓住故事要点、情绪变化和音乐细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1cc5a0f6-3ddd-4925-9074-a2073eed7b07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001855390810Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:59.643863+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c4611c4d83a5908ceb27dd07bd71eef4c9a30fb9c2bc0251bbc1bd99feb97dc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e